    "sourceBlob": "40c7de756a62b42a326102e2fdfea01a3522453d",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy casts a spell that targets you or an ally within 15 feet of you</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You interpose your shield's ward against the spell. Attempt a counteract check, using your Religion modifier as your counteract modifier. On a success, the spell is counteracted and your shield takes damage equal to four times the spell rank as it absorbs and disperses the magical energy. On a failure, the shield takes damage equal to twice the spell's rank.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger An enemy casts a spell that targets you or an ally within 15 feet of you You interpose your shield's ward against the spell. Attempt a counteract check, using your Religion modifier as your counteract modifier. On a success, the spell is counteracted and your shield takes damage equal to four times the spell rank as it absorbs and disperses the magical energy. On a failure, the shield takes damage equal to twice the spell's rank.",
