    "sourceBlob": "69bcfb5b59e449f3ee2339164c81f4f4adef19e5",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Your ostilli pulses a calm lavender color as it converts stored magic into a curative balm. You regain @Damage[((2*floor(@actor.level/4))d4)[healing]] Hit Points, and you can immediately attempt a flat check to recover from persistent bleed damage with the DC reduced to 10. This healing increases by 2d4 at 8th level and every 4 levels thereafter.</p>",
