    "sourceBlob": "2a1ffc1ee487c8c311cacbb375554d66f7ddaa43",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> a number of times per day equal to your level</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You envenom your fangs. If the next fangs Strike you make before the end of your turn hits and deals damage, the Strike deals an additional 1d6 poison damage. On a critical failure, the poison is wasted as normal. At 12th level, this poison damage increases to 2d6.</p>",
