    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "legacy",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens The Mwangi Expanse",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/actions/ancestry/shisk/barbed-quills.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/actions/ancestry/shisk/barbed-quills.json",
    "sourceBlob": "ac93f30b1812afcd13c3f03419a9b407afe22971",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are hit with an unarmed strike or a strike with a non-reach melee weapon.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You break off quills in your attacker's flesh. You deal @Damage[ceil(@actor.level/2)d8[piercing]] damage to the triggering creature (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic] save using your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.) On a critical failure, the creature also takes @Damage[(1d4+ceil(@actor.level/2)-1)[bleed]] as your quills hook into its flesh. At 3rd level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d8 and the persistent piercing damage increases by 1.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day Trigger You are hit with an unarmed strike or a strike with a non-reach melee weapon. You break off quills in your attacker's flesh. You deal damage piercing damage to the triggering creature (reflex check save using your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.) On a critical failure, the creature also takes damage bleed as your quills hook into its flesh. At 3rd level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d8 and the persistent piercing damage increases by 1.",
