    "sourceBlob": "4ba24499b65966fb0bd6618586f5631e23001749",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail a saving throw against an enchantment effect</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Your bestial manifestation becomes more pronounced, and your mind gains a flash of clarity as your instincts take over. You can reroll the triggering saving throw with a +2 circumstance bonus, but you must use the new result. This is a fortune effect.</p>",
