    "sourceBlob": "38365289535728d8097c4f63f63fae80b43ecc28",
    "description": "<p>You aim your weapon in a superficial cut above your opponent's eye. Make a Strike with the imbued ikon. If that Strike is successful, the target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|against:exemplar] save against your class DC or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] for 1 round or until it uses an Interact action to clear the blood from its vision.</p>",
