    "sourceBlob": "6d95742b96763a26673a588a60565951f242cbf9",
    "description": "<p>Either Stride twice or attempt an @Check[acrobatics] check (DC determined by the GM, but usually DC 20) to swing up to twice your Speed on a rope or similar object, then Strike.</p>\n<p>If you boarded or disembarked from a boat or similar vehicle during this movement, the Strike deals one additional weapon damage die.</p>",
