    "sourceBlob": "065c8bb57848d80db152a9c50208cdf86ae44ceb",
    "description": "<p>Your squad dashes past enemies, slicing their boot laces and breaking their belt buckles. Signal up to two squadmates within the aura of your commander's banner; these squadmates can Stride up to their Speed as a reaction. Each enemy they are adjacent to at any point during this movement must attempt a @Check[reflex|against:commander|options:inflicts:clumsy] save against your class DC or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} for 1 round (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 2} on a critical failure).</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Your squad dashes past enemies, slicing their boot laces and breaking their belt buckles. Signal up to two squadmates within the aura of your commander's banner; these squadmates can Stride up to their Speed as a reaction. Each enemy they are adjacent to at any point during this movement must attempt a reflex check save against your class DC or become Clumsy 1 for 1 round (Clumsy 2 on a critical failure).",
