    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder War of Immortals",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/actions/class/exemplar/burn-out-of-time.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/actions/class/exemplar/burn-out-of-time.json",
    "sourceBlob": "2effcdb347002ced88b920bbd6c3e4280cb03c4e",
    "description": "<p>An impossible amount of energy blazes in a sphere above you before compressing itself into your weapon. Strike one creature. The Strike deals an additional 3d8 spirit damage and 3d8 void damage. If the creature is reduced to 0 Hit Points, it's immediately killed and reduced to ash, not in the present, but in the recent past, erasing the consequences of their recent actions.</p>\n<p>If a creature died within the last round as a result of the incinerated target's actions, that creature is returned to life with @Damage[5d8[healing]] Hit Points at the location that it died as its death is retroactively undone.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "An impossible amount of energy blazes in a sphere above you before compressing itself into your weapon. Strike one creature. The Strike deals an additional 3d8 spirit damage and 3d8 void damage. If the creature is reduced to 0 Hit Points, it's immediately killed and reduced to ash, not in the present, but in the recent past, erasing the consequences of their recent actions. If a creature died within the last round as a result of the incinerated target's actions, that creature is returned to life with damage healing Hit Points at the location that it died as its death is retroactively undone.",
