    "description": "<p>Given by Rite of Knowing</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are about to attempt a check to Recall Knowledge. You call upon the knowledge of Axis to ensure the accuracy of your information. You roll a second time and use the higher result. If you roll a critical failure, you get a failure instead. If you roll a success, you get a critical success instead.</p>",
