    "sourceBlob": "fb173cd6b5f074a43d2315550eb4aaf26ef4d8c5",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> determined by your catharsis emotion</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You gain the catharsis activation effects listed for your catharsis emotion. You gain that emotion's emotional fervor benefits for 3 rounds. When your emotional fervor ends, you suffer the listed emotional fallout. After using Catharsis, you can't use it again until you use the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Settle Emotions] activity.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Emotional Fervor]</p>",
