    "publication": "Pathfinder Guns & Gears",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/actions/class/gunslinger/covered-reload.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/actions/class/gunslinger/covered-reload.json",
    "sourceBlob": "3d18c79cacd74639ab55bd9afb2e4a60563fd864",
    "description": "<p>You duck into a safe position or minimize your profile while reloading to make your next attack. Either @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Take Cover] or attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hide], then Interact to reload. As normal, you must meet the requirements to Take Cover or Hide; you must be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone], benefiting from cover, or near a feature that allows you to Take Cover, and you need to be benefiting from cover or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed] to a creature to Hide from that creature.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You duck into a safe position or minimize your profile while reloading to make your next attack. Either Take Cover or attempt to Hide, then Interact to reload. As normal, you must meet the requirements to Take Cover or Hide; you must be Prone, benefiting from cover, or near a feature that allows you to Take Cover, and you need to be benefiting from cover or Concealed to a creature to Hide from that creature.",
