    "sourceBlob": "fae9384013dce39c5f8d89d01fc8b743681d7c38",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Void energy seeps out of you, decaying everything within a @Template[emanation|distance:5] and causing plants and foliage to age and decompose. Natural difficult terrain is destroyed, and creatures in the area with the plant or wood trait take @Damage[1d6[void]|options:area-damage] damage with a @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day Effect Void energy seeps out of you, decaying everything within a emanation area template distance 5 and causing plants and foliage to age and decompose. Natural difficult terrain is destroyed, and creatures in the area with the plant or wood trait take damage void damage with a fortitude check save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.",
