    "sourceBlob": "95cbd925d54dd7f1fe7e5f9f129b66968caaa38f",
    "description": "<p>You call for a careful retreat. Signal all squadmates within the aura of your banner; each can immediately Step up to three times as a free action. Each Step must take them farther away from at least one hostile creature they are observing and can only take them closer to a hostile creature if doing so is the only way for them to move toward safety (such as if they're surrounded).</p>",
