    "sourceBlob": "47e47e6e459d66b7bdc5a131f94cce79b7fb7007",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature Casts a Spell with you as the only target</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Your ostilli radiates cyan light as its tentacle-like filters attempt to consume the magical effect. You can attempt to counteract the triggering spell with an @Check[arcana] or @Check[nature] check and a counteract rank equal to half your level.</p>",
