    "sourceBlob": "f6413eab53ca735949a6b2c544bd740ccc8b9abe",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You breathe deeply and exhale a line or cone of powerful breath, much like the dragon with which you made the pact. If the dragon had a cone-shaped breath, your breath is a @Template[type:cone|distance:30]. If they had a line-shaped breath, your breath is a @Template[type:line|distance:60]. If they had a burst-shaped breath, your breath is a @Template[type:burst|distance:10] within 60 feet. No matter the shape, it deals 1d6 damage per level (@Damage[(@actor.level)d6[untyped]|options:area-damage]), of the same damage type as the dragon's breath, with a @Check[reflex|basic|against:class-spell|options:area-effect] save, using the higher of your class DC or spell DC. This action has the same traits as the breath of the dragon you made the pact with.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per hour Effect You breathe deeply and exhale a line or cone of powerful breath, much like the dragon with which you made the pact. If the dragon had a cone-shaped breath, your breath is a type:cone area template distance 30. If they had a line-shaped breath, your breath is a type:line area template distance 60. If they had a burst-shaped breath, your breath is a type:burst area template distance 10 within 60 feet. No matter the shape, it deals 1d6 damage per level (damage ), of the same damage type as the dragon's breath, with a reflex check save, using the higher of your class DC or spell DC. This action has the same traits as the breath of the dragon you made the pact with.",
