    "sourceBlob": "a203de43efb70024a81faf4740512bb0769ce7f8",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy you can see would reduce this spell's target to 0 Hit Points</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragon intercepts, preventing the spell's target from being knocked out; the spell's target remains at 1 Hit Point. As the dragon disappears, it flies over the triggering enemy and releases its retributive breath, dealing @Damage[5d4[spirit]] damage to it with a @Check[reflex|basic] save.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger An enemy you can see would reduce this spell's target to 0 Hit Points Effect The dragon intercepts, preventing the spell's target from being knocked out; the spell's target remains at 1 Hit Point. As the dragon disappears, it flies over the triggering enemy and releases its retributive breath, dealing damage spirit damage to it with a reflex check save.",
