    "sourceBlob": "a95cd88162785941a59a05b7057f391c97c438a2",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Energy bursts forth from your body. You deal @Damage[ceil(@actor.level/2)d6[@actor.flags.system.elementalHeartDwarf.damageType]|options:area-damage] damage to all adjacent creatures (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] save using your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher). At 3rd level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d6 damage.</p>",
