    "sourceBlob": "515cfac34c80d8d58db99a4a7fae5b313b34f8ad",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Through use of either saliva or blood, you use your innate toxins to apply vishkanyan venom to your weapon or a piece of ammunition. To use your blood, you must be injured, or you can deal @Damage[1[slashing]] damage to yourself as part of the action. The vishkanyan venom remains potent until the end of your next turn, or until you expend it as normal for an injury poison by either hitting a target or critically failing an attack roll.</p>\n<p><strong>Minor Vishkanyan Venom</strong> (injury, poison)</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|against:class-spell|traits:injury,poison,damaging-effect]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[1d4[poison]] damage (1 round)</p>",
