    "sourceBlob": "c3e3519988bffc3057b720aee81c8c6cbb33162c",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are dying</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Draw a harrow card, and you automatically lose the dying condition, though you remain @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Unconscious] at 0 Hit Points. If the card you drew was from the suit of Shields, you awaken and have an amount of Hit Points restored to you equal to @Damage[(1d6+@actor.level)[healing]]{1d6 + your level}.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You are dying Frequency once per day Effect Draw a harrow card, and you automatically lose the dying condition, though you remain Unconscious at 0 Hit Points. If the card you drew was from the suit of Shields, you awaken and have an amount of Hit Points restored to you equal to 1d6 + your level.",
