    "sourceBlob": "dc2dfe66c404ed64cc83a627fef0a6fd376562a3",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature that you can see uses a mental effect against you</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The triggering creature must attempt a Will save, which has the following effects.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}, and you gain a +2 status bonus to your saving throw or other defense against the triggering mental effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is frightened 2, and you're unaffected by the triggering mental effect.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger A creature that you can see uses a mental effect against you Effect The triggering creature must attempt a Will save, which has the following effects. Success The creature is unaffected. Failure The creature is Frightened 2, and you gain a +2 status bonus to your saving throw or other defense against the triggering mental effect. Critical Failure The creature is frightened 2, and you're unaffected by the triggering mental effect.",
