    "sourceBlob": "b58a9959b962e1b98ecd64c52b8e08dff2646fa3",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You attempt a saving throw against a spell or magic effect but haven't rolled yet</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You find some kind of fault with the magic, using that flaw to protect yourself from the effect. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your saving throw against the triggering effect, which increases to a +2 circumstance bonus if the effect is divine and originates from a worshipper of the deity you chose for your grudge.</p>",
