    "sourceBlob": "440d8e6fa3a03981fe6f60572c986b46fa0a639f",
    "description": "<p>Your eidolon makes a melee Strike. This counts as two attacks when calculating your multiple attack penalty. If this Strike hits, your eidolon deals an extra die of weapon damage and gains a +1 circumstance bonus to the damage roll.</p>\n<p>If you're at least 10th level, increase this to two extra dice with a +2 circumstance bonus, and if you're at least 18th level, increase it to three extra dice with a +3 circumstance bonus.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Your eidolon makes a melee Strike. This counts as two attacks when calculating your multiple attack penalty. If this Strike hits, your eidolon deals an extra die of weapon damage and gains a +1 circumstance bonus to the damage roll. If you're at least 10th level, increase this to two extra dice with a +2 circumstance bonus, and if you're at least 18th level, increase it to three extra dice with a +3 circumstance bonus.",
    "descriptionHash": "a93509c88fb31fd0af06a0079a63ea6515a5a72aaeea8464b81e24a0506f6a98",
