    "sourceBlob": "bdfed0589171f368dc74f8ffcb1a83f7b9a136f5",
    "description": "<p>You shoot the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Starshot], causing a detonation in a @Template[type:burst|distance:5] within 60 feet. Each creature in the area must succeed at a @Check[reflex|against:exemplar|basic|options:area-effect] save against your class DC or take spirit damage equal to your normal Strike damage with the starshot. Creatures larger than you take a –2 circumstance penalty to their saving throws. This shot requires any ammunition that would normally be required for the weapon.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You shoot the Starshot, causing a detonation in a type:burst area template distance 5 within 60 feet. Each creature in the area must succeed at a reflex check save against your class DC or take spirit damage equal to your normal Strike damage with the starshot. Creatures larger than you take a –2 circumstance penalty to their saving throws. This shot requires any ammunition that would normally be required for the weapon.",
