    "sourceBlob": "4079b4a58488f2120ac7a352ffe2349f3c4ea7aa",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your last action was a successful piercing or slashing melee Strike against a creature that is not immune to bleed</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You consume the blood lingering upon your weapon. You reduce the value of your drained condition by 1, gain temporary Hit Points equal to your Constitution modifier, and gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against that creature's spells for 1 minute, or until you Harvest Blood from another creature.</p>",
