    "sourceBlob": "b19abf03301877f70f6b6522111c8e921c317cf1",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your eidolon is condensed.</p><hr /><p>Your eidolon suddenly shifts itself into a terrifying shape of its choosing, rather than a simple mound, by closely controlling the positioning of its component bodies. The eidolon attempts to [[/act demoralize]] a creature within 15 feet; this Demoralize attempt loses the auditory trait, gains the visual trait, and the eidolon doesn't take a –4 circumstance penalty to the check if they don't share a language with their target. On a success or critical success, the target is additionally @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] for 1 round.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements Your eidolon is condensed. Your eidolon suddenly shifts itself into a terrifying shape of its choosing, rather than a simple mound, by closely controlling the positioning of its component bodies. The eidolon attempts to [[/act demoralize]] a creature within 15 feet; this Demoralize attempt loses the auditory trait, gains the visual trait, and the eidolon doesn't take a –4 circumstance penalty to the check if they don't share a language with their target. On a success or critical success, the target is additionally Off Guard for 1 round.",
