    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Spend 1 Mythic Point. The spirits of four runelords of wrath (Angothane, Xiren, Thybidos, and Alaznist) swirl around you for 1 minute. While the spirits remain, whenever you hit or critically hit with a Reactive Strike, the target takes an additional 5 spirit damage, or 10 spirit damage if the target of your Reactive Strike is Xanderghul, the Runelord of Pride.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day Effect Spend 1 Mythic Point. The spirits of four runelords of wrath (Angothane, Xiren, Thybidos, and Alaznist) swirl around you for 1 minute. While the spirits remain, whenever you hit or critically hit with a Reactive Strike, the target takes an additional 5 spirit damage, or 10 spirit damage if the target of your Reactive Strike is Xanderghul, the Runelord of Pride.",
