    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are hit with an unarmed Strike or a Strike with a non-reach melee weapon</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You twist your body so that the attacker hits a hard edge of bone or armor, injuring themselves. You deal @Damage[(floor(@actor.level/2))d8[piercing]] damage to the triggering creature (basic Reflex save using your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher). At 3rd level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d8.</p>",
