    "sourceBlob": "c0732ecfec32049234caf94b639ce0acc6417294",
    "description": "<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Exploit Vulnerability]</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're benefiting from Exploit Vulnerability, you can see the subject, and you haven't used Exploit Vulnerability this round.</p><hr /><p>You present your implement and esoterica again, intensifying their effects on the target in a way unique to your implement. You gain the intensified vulnerability benefit from one of the implements you're holding, which lasts until the beginning of your next turn.</p>",
