    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 60 feet gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened] condition.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You are invigorated by the shock of a prank or the thrum of terror. You gain temporary Hit Points equal to the creature's level or 3, whichever is higher. You lose any temporary Hit Points after 1 minute.</p>",
