    "sourceBlob": "ab541d79909cb9a33897b6cf487a238db0555139",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your lantern light is shining</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Your lenses focus your light into a searing beam. You deal @Damage[((max(5,ceil(@actor.level/2)))d4)[fire]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in a @Template[line|distance:30], with a @Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] saving throw against the higher of your class DC or spell DC. Your lantern light then extinguishes, and you can't use this ability or use your lantern light again for [[/r 1d4 #Recharge Lantern Beam]]{1d4 rounds}. At 11th level and every two levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d4.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements Your lantern light is shining Effect Your lenses focus your light into a searing beam. You deal damage fire damage to all creatures in a line area template distance 30, with a reflex check saving throw against the higher of your class DC or spell DC. Your lantern light then extinguishes, and you can't use this ability or use your lantern light again for [[/r 1d4 #Recharge Lantern Beam]]{1d4 rounds}. At 11th level and every two levels thereafter, the damage increases by 1d4.",
