    "sourceBlob": "affa719eddaed53c6642aa86cccf6751823f2d71",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> If summoning a soulforged weapon or shield, you have the hands free to wield it; if summoning soulforged armor, you aren't wearing any armor</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You immediately wield or wear the soulforged armament bound to you. The soulforged armament remains manifested until you Dismiss this effect.</p>\n<p>Once per day when you use this ability, you can manifest the armament's essence form. You gain the armament's essence power until it's Dismissed. After 1 minute, the essence form armament is automatically Dismissed.</p>",
