    "sourceBlob": "277bfc799c9f1b4d1907b7a7d9ca30ff4120af21",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your horde has been raised</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Each enemy in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:5] around your horde takes @Damage[(ternary(gte(@actor.level,18),8,ternary(gte(@actor.level,14),6,ternary(gte(@actor.level,10),4,2))))d6[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage] damage (if your horde is zombies) or @Damage[(ternary(gte(@actor.level,18),8,ternary(gte(@actor.level,14),6,ternary(gte(@actor.level,10),4,2))))d6[slashing]|options:area-damage] damage (if your horde is skeletons) with a @Check[reflex|against:spell|basic|options:area-effect] save against your spell DC. At 10th level and every 4 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 2d6.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements Your horde has been raised Effect Each enemy in a type:emanation area template distance 5 around your horde takes damage bludgeoning damage (if your horde is zombies) or damage slashing damage (if your horde is skeletons) with a reflex check save against your spell DC. At 10th level and every 4 levels thereafter, the damage increases by 2d6.",
