    "description": "<p>Your instructions make it easier for you and your allies to swim through dangerous waters. Signal all squadmates; until the end of your next turn, you and each ally gain a swim Speed of 20 feet.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Naval Training]</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you have this tactic prepared, you can use [[/act swim skill=warfare-lore]]{Warfare Lore} in place of Athletics for checks you make to Swim.</p>",
