    "sourceBlob": "512a96b4a723686dd8cf5af603feb859fbead637",
    "description": "<p>You share a story of your travels with a creature within 30 feet. You gain the blessing of Isthralei as a +1 status bonus to AC and Will saves until the end of your next turn. On their next turn, the creature you shared a story with can take a single action, which has the auditory, concentrate, linguistic, and mental traits, to respond with their own story to gain the same benefits until the end of the following turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Offer Story]</p>",
