    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Spore War Player's Guide",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/actions/background/opportunistic-accusation.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/actions/background/opportunistic-accusation.json",
    "sourceBlob": "1b81ecd8caea1f0026a26cd585b34a5b061d449d",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A demon you're aware of within 30 feet of you suffers from its sin vulnerability or critical fails at a saving throw against a mental effect</p><hr /><p>You make a quick cutting remark against the demon that takes advantage of the fiend's momentary disadvantage. The demon must attempt a @Check[will|against:class] save against your class DC.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The demon is unaffected and likely to focus its attention on you in combat from this point forward.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The demon takes @Damage[2d6[mental]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The demon takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until the start of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the off-guard condition lasts until the end of the next round. The demon also takes @Damage[2d6[persistent,mental]] damage.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger A demon you're aware of within 30 feet of you suffers from its sin vulnerability or critical fails at a saving throw against a mental effect You make a quick cutting remark against the demon that takes advantage of the fiend's momentary disadvantage. The demon must attempt a will check save against your class DC. Critical Success The demon is unaffected and likely to focus its attention on you in combat from this point forward. Success The demon takes damage mental damage. Failure The demon takes damage mental damage and is Off Guard until the start of its next turn. Critical Failure As failure, but the off-guard condition lasts until the end of the next round. The demon also takes damage mental damage.",
    "descriptionHash": "fae393db7d64b7f6ab21d096599efc650b69832f4b0b7c2a129009e47c920159",
