    "sourceBlob": "ca873edb94298db2b53b7b7d6a0ff9e9bf284d20",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are not observed by any enemies</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You phase yourself into the interstices, veiling yourself from physical reality. You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed]. You can use this concealment to [[/act hide]] or [[/act sneak]] as your disassociation from reality makes you difficult to focus on. If you use a hostile action, this effect ends after the action is complete; otherwise, it lasts for 1 minute.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You are not observed by any enemies Effect You phase yourself into the interstices, veiling yourself from physical reality. You become Concealed. You can use this concealment to [[/act hide]] or [[/act sneak]] as your disassociation from reality makes you difficult to focus on. If you use a hostile action, this effect ends after the action is complete; otherwise, it lasts for 1 minute.",
