    "sourceBlob": "08bd6b397ab21450cd69fc5398eda6562d6a8c88",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> A palpable weight extends from your familiar in a @Template[emanation|distance:15]. Enemies who enter or start their turn within the aura must succeed at a Will save against your spell DC or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} as long as they remain within the aura, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 3} on a critical failure. The aura lasts until the end of your next turn, but the familiar can Sustain it up to 1 minute.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per hour Effect A palpable weight extends from your familiar in a emanation area template distance 15. Enemies who enter or start their turn within the aura must succeed at a Will save against your spell DC or become Stupefied 2 as long as they remain within the aura, or Stupefied 3 on a critical failure. The aura lasts until the end of your next turn, but the familiar can Sustain it up to 1 minute.",
