    "sourceBlob": "100645728e53b133f71444453a3ff704d8149d98",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fall at least 10 feet and take no damage from the fall</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You tuck and roll with the motion. You land on your feet and Stride up to half your Speed</p>",
