    "sourceBlob": "4be2a9ac9429a4cb0fd714468d3aadb9f0998758",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>You command your squadmates to perform a devastating coordinated takedown. Signal up to three squadmates within the aura of your commander's banner who all have the same enemy within their reach; the squadmates can attempt to Strike, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Trip], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple] the opponent as a reaction. Each squadmate can only attempt one specific action granted by this tactic, the actions can be attempted in any order and a specific action can only be attempted once as part of this tactic.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per 10 minutes You command your squadmates to perform a devastating coordinated takedown. Signal up to three squadmates within the aura of your commander's banner who all have the same enemy within their reach; the squadmates can attempt to Strike, Trip, or Grapple the opponent as a reaction. Each squadmate can only attempt one specific action granted by this tactic, the actions can be attempted in any order and a specific action can only be attempted once as part of this tactic.",
