    "sourceBlob": "a6a9d20eb9642b8deab0e6531cc8f06a7cc700dc",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your last action was to deal piercing damage to an enemy within your reach</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Attempt an Athletics check to [[/act grapple]] the same enemy. The weapon that dealt the triggering damage gains the grapple trait for this check. On a success, the target also takes @Damage[1d8[persistent,piercing]] damage (or @Damage[2d8[persistent,piercing]] damage on a critical success). When the target is no longer @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] by you, the persistent damage ends.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger Your last action was to deal piercing damage to an enemy within your reach Effect Attempt an Athletics check to [[/act grapple]] the same enemy. The weapon that dealt the triggering damage gains the grapple trait for this check. On a success, the target also takes damage piercing damage (or damage piercing damage on a critical success). When the target is no longer Grabbed or Restrained by you, the persistent damage ends.",
