    "sourceBlob": "38bd5131696881bddb9accbb1e529874d8c32294",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Thick slabs of stone rise around you before tilting over. You deal @Damage[(ceil(@actor.level/2)d6)[bludgeoning]] damage to all adjacent creatures (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic] against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher). On a critical failure, the creature is also knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]. At 3rd level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day Effect Thick slabs of stone rise around you before tilting over. You deal damage bludgeoning damage to all adjacent creatures (reflex check against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher). On a critical failure, the creature is also knocked Prone. At 3rd level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d6.",
