    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your previous action was a successful Strike with the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Mortal Harvest]</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Time seems to lag as you blur across the battlefield, deciding the fate of many in a moment. Stride up to half your Speed and make another melee Strike with the mortal harvest against a different creature.</p>\n<p>This Strike uses the same multiple attack penalty as your previous Strike, but counts toward your multiple attack penalty as normal.</p>",
