    "sourceBlob": "937775857255af4c91d6fbe2ce6064603582aade",
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a firearm or crossbow in one hand, and your other hand either wields a one-handed melee weapon or is empty.</p><hr /><p>You make a melee attack and reload in one fluid movement. Strike an opponent within reach with your one-handed melee weapon (or, if your other hand is empty, with an unarmed attack), and then Interact to reload. You don't need a free hand to reload in this way and this reload does not trigger reactions.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Requirements You're wielding a firearm or crossbow in one hand, and your other hand either wields a one-handed melee weapon or is empty. You make a melee attack and reload in one fluid movement. Strike an opponent within reach with your one-handed melee weapon (or, if your other hand is empty, with an unarmed attack), and then Interact to reload. You don't need a free hand to reload in this way and this reload does not trigger reactions.",
