    "sourceBlob": "3ce7e079263faef2b9d3bdccd90ef29faf7b51f2",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You roll a skill check or saving throw and don't like the result.</p><hr /><p>Destiny, fate, or some other force bends around you as your mythic power swells, manifesting in a flash of light or visible surge of energy emanating from your body as you cast aside the chains of fate. You expend a Mythic Point and reroll the check or save with mythic proficiency, taking the new result.</p>",
