    "sourceBlob": "087e29a01f260a123a134a1a7577e52f4f099498",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature deals damage to you with a spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You gain a measure of revenge immediately by twisting the magic used by the triggering creature. Spend a Mythic Point. The triggering creature takes @Damage[6d8[force]] damage, with a @Check[will|against:class-spell|basic] saving throw against either your class DC or spell DC using mythic proficiency, whichever is higher. At 14th level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d8.</p>",
