    "sourceBlob": "56471ab50f08073bfb287e2685e742da0db2dda6",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your turn begins, and you are commanding a troop</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You encourage your followers to persevere against all hardships. The troop you command gains temporary Hit Points equal to twice your level which last for 1 minutes. If your troop's size would be reduced due to damage, you can attempt a @Check[flat|dc:16]; on a success, your troop's size isn't reduced at that threshold until the end of your next turn.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per day Trigger Your turn begins, and you are commanding a troop Effect You encourage your followers to persevere against all hardships. The troop you command gains temporary Hit Points equal to twice your level which last for 1 minutes. If your troop's size would be reduced due to damage, you can attempt a flat check; on a success, your troop's size isn't reduced at that threshold until the end of your next turn.",
