    "sourceBlob": "8deffac00f7040cf94a2cff272e697a071649f9d",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy in your champion's aura damages you</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Your self-interest keeps you safe. You gain resistance against the triggering damage equal to 2 + half your level, regardless of damage type.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Selfish Shield]</p>\n<p>In addition, your Strikes against the triggering creature deal 1 extra spirit damage until the end of your next turn. This extra damage increases to 2 at 9th level and 3 at 16th level.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Champion's Extra Damage]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger An enemy in your champion's aura damages you Effect Your self-interest keeps you safe. You gain resistance against the triggering damage equal to 2 + half your level, regardless of damage type. Effect: Selfish Shield In addition, your Strikes against the triggering creature deal 1 extra spirit damage until the end of your next turn. This extra damage increases to 2 at 9th level and 3 at 16th level. Effect: Champion's Extra Damage",
