    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The familiar is in dim light or darkness.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The familiar teleports itself up to 30 feet. The destination must be in dim light or darkness and must be within your familiar's line of sight and line of effect.</p>\n<p>This action has the trait matching your tradition of magic, or occult if you aren't a spellcaster.</p>",
