    "sourceBlob": "4cb90bc420759f54e71ea1d9f35c907ff13a3e07",
    "description": "<p>Your commands help your team evade notice. Signal all squadmates within your banner's aura; until the end of your next turn, you and each ally count as Following the Expert for any checks to [[/act hide]] or [[/act sneak]] and can ignore the noisy trait on any armor you wear. If you spend 2 actions to use this tactic, up to two squadmates within your banner's aura can also either Hide or Sneak as a free action.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you have this tactic prepared, you can use Warfare Lore in place of Stealth for checks you attempt to Hide and Sneak.</p>",
