    "sourceBlob": "b2fd044b1f0ab2500ecbef4ffd35fbba82f6be2f",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An adjacent creature Strikes you with a melee weapon or unarmed attack and deals damage</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your innate @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mountain Resilience] from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Glass Skin] is active</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You shatter some of the glass on your skin to damage your attacker. The attacker takes @Damage[3d10[slashing]] damage and the duration of the stoneskin decreases by 1 minute. At 14th level, the damage increases to @Damage[4d10[slashing]] damage, and at 18th level, the damage increases to @Damage[5d10[slashing]] damage.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger An adjacent creature Strikes you with a melee weapon or unarmed attack and deals damage Requirements Your innate Mountain Resilience from Glass Skin is active Effect You shatter some of the glass on your skin to damage your attacker. The attacker takes damage slashing damage and the duration of the stoneskin decreases by 1 minute. At 14th level, the damage increases to damage slashing damage, and at 18th level, the damage increases to damage slashing damage.",
