    "sourceBlob": "b48d056a43018b8e959487df1324f884a274942a",
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> 1 spirit wisp</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You immediately purify a spirit, which grants you a protective blessing before it departs. If your next action is to cast a halcyon spell, you gain a +1 status bonus to saving throws as well as resistance to void damage equal to the rank of the halcyon spell. These effects last for 1 round.</p>",
