    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You take vitality or void damage, or you take any type of damage caused by a haunt, ghost, or other incorporeal undead</p>\n<p><strong>Cost</strong> 1 spirit wisp or remnant</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You purify a spirit by having it perform a final act of mercy to lessen the damage caused by another spirit. This grants you resistance to vitality and void damage (or resistance to all damage if caused by a haunt or incorporeal undead) against the triggering effect. If you expend a spirit wisp, the resistance is equal to twice your level. If you expend a spirit remnant, the resistance is equal to three times the level of the incorporeal undead or haunt from which you gained the remnant.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You take vitality or void damage, or you take any type of damage caused by a haunt, ghost, or other incorporeal undead Cost 1 spirit wisp or remnant Effect You purify a spirit by having it perform a final act of mercy to lessen the damage caused by another spirit. This grants you resistance to vitality and void damage (or resistance to all damage if caused by a haunt or incorporeal undead) against the triggering effect. If you expend a spirit wisp, the resistance is equal to twice your level. If you expend a spirit remnant, the resistance is equal to three times the level of the incorporeal undead or haunt from which you gained the remnant.",
    "descriptionHash": "0a8e4c268448a9e1551b8126d5afb312ee09c4392efafc88fea35e2400a874fe",
