    "sourceBlob": "719701cd7f527a2d81344b78d672cf82dda4a869",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within 30 feet would become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained]</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You call out a quick reminder to your ally about a special move you'd suggested to them at some point in the past, allowing the ally to avoid the triggering effect completely.</p>",
