    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are holding your censer implement.</p><hr /><p>You swing your censer in a wide arc, causing the smoke it issues to thicken. Until the start of your next turn, creatures within the smoke are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Concealed], and all creatures outside the smoke are concealed to those within it.</p>",
