    "sourceBlob": "41842ba9a9c362e2e0d820da6c0fa338e2fca904",
    "description": "<p>You speak a bizarre koan that transcends language and is understood by only one creature within 30 feet. The target must attempt a @Check[will|against:exemplar] save against your class DC. It's then immune to this ability for 1 hour.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is stupefied 1 for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is stupefied 1 and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Confused] for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "You speak a bizarre koan that transcends language and is understood by only one creature within 30 feet. The target must attempt a will check save against your class DC. It's then immune to this ability for 1 hour. Critical Success The target is unaffected. Success The target is Stupefied 1 for 1 round. Failure The target is stupefied 1 for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}. Critical Failure The target is stupefied 1 and Confused for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.",
