    "sourceBlob": "a86f39556558ecb2d22187eab7b28dc89a32d1e9",
    "description": "<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> or <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><hr /><p>Your fingers dance, glowing light leaving behind the image of a rune. You apply one rune to an adjacent target matching the rune's Usage entry. You can have any number of runes traced at a time, but each rune remains only until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p>If you spend 2 actions to Trace a Rune, you draw the rune in the air, causing it to appear on a target within 30 feet.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "1 or 2 Your fingers dance, glowing light leaving behind the image of a rune. You apply one rune to an adjacent target matching the rune's Usage entry. You can have any number of runes traced at a time, but each rune remains only until the end of your next turn. If you spend 2 actions to Trace a Rune, you draw the rune in the air, causing it to appear on a target within 30 feet.",
