    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Envenom] action hasn't been expended.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You quickly envenom poisonous saliva on your weapon as you draw it. Interact to draw a weapon, and then Envenom it. This uses up your daily use of Envenom.</p>",
