    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Impossible Magic",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/actions/class/summoner/visions-of-sin.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/actions/class/summoner/visions-of-sin.json",
    "sourceBlob": "1d53b92c313f15d00ea67a7bafedfc0fc3935333",
    "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Your eidolon summons images of their sin into the mind of a target creature within 30 feet, tormenting and confusing the target. The target must attempt a Will save against your spell DC with the following effects. The effects last until the end of your next turn, but your eidolon can Sustain the effects to a maximum duration of 1 minute. If the target is unholy, it takes a –2 circumstance penalty to its save. Regardless of whether it succeeds, the target becomes temporarily immune for 1 day.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target can't use reactions.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} and can't use reactions.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Confused] for 1 round. The confusion can't be extended, but the other effects can.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Frequency once per 10 minutes Effect Your eidolon summons images of their sin into the mind of a target creature within 30 feet, tormenting and confusing the target. The target must attempt a Will save against your spell DC with the following effects. The effects last until the end of your next turn, but your eidolon can Sustain the effects to a maximum duration of 1 minute. If the target is unholy, it takes a –2 circumstance penalty to its save. Regardless of whether it succeeds, the target becomes temporarily immune for 1 day. Critical Success The target is unaffected. Success The target can't use reactions. Failure The target is Slowed 1 and can't use reactions. Critical Failure As failure, and the target is also Confused for 1 round. The confusion can't be extended, but the other effects can.",
