    "path": "packs/pf2e/actions/ancestry/ghoran/wicked-thorns.json",
    "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/foundryvtt/pf2e/blob/581c2bf2ca9734f4dd83f034fbcc93f8e4fd96eb/packs/pf2e/actions/ancestry/ghoran/wicked-thorns.json",
    "sourceBlob": "eeae85132858793e6493b4fcbec938d1eee09a76",
    "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You're hit with an unarmed Strike or a Strike with a non-reach melee weapon.</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p>Several of your thorns break off and hook into your attacker's body. You deal @Damage[(ceil(@actor.level/2)d8)[piercing]] damage to the triggering creature. It attempts a @Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic] save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC. On a critical failure, the creature also takes @Damage[(1d4+ceil(@actor.level/2)-1)[bleed]] damage as your thorns embed in its flesh.</p>\n<p>At 3rd level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d8, and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Trigger You're hit with an unarmed Strike or a Strike with a non-reach melee weapon. Frequency once per day Several of your thorns break off and hook into your attacker's body. You deal damage piercing damage to the triggering creature. It attempts a reflex check save against the higher of your class DC or spell DC. On a critical failure, the creature also takes damage bleed damage as your thorns embed in its flesh. At 3rd level, and every 2 levels thereafter, this damage increases by 1d8, and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1.",
